<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54475" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμάρπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>catch</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥς κεν ἔμ᾽ ἔντοσθεν πόλιος
					καταμάρψῃ ἐόντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.364
				</span></i>
			; esp. <i>catch, overtake</i> one running away, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτε δὴ κατέμαρπτε διώκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.65
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				16.598
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				3.35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ γαῖ᾽ αὐτόν τέ νιν καὶ . .
					ἵππους ἔμαρψεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>O.</u>
					6.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ κατὰ γῆρας ἔμαρψεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.390
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλον δ᾽ οὐ -έμαρψε δίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					207
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέσσον ἔσφαλε τέχνα
			-μάρψας</span>' <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ μητέρα πότμος ἔμαρψε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1389i17
				</span></i>
			.</div>
